<title>SPAIN: Spain brokers 9-mo pretax profit up 36.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain brokers 9-mo pretax profit up 36.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish stock brokers posted a 36.2 percent increase in pretax profit to 20.8 billion pesetas in the nine months to September, stock market commission CNMV said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>CNMV highlighted an eight percent fall in average total assets in the third quarter versus the second, explained by a reduction in portfolios.</p>
<p>Equity transactions rose 25.4 percent in the third quarter versus the second, with the bulk of the rise concentrated in large brokerages.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
